"  shift DIR --request-file F --hypothesis T (--no-premises|--premise T ...) --claim T --example T --check ID --checks-that T",
"  add 'FACT' ... [--by human|agent] [--doc TEXT]",
"  subject ID PATH",
"  attest TYPE SUBJECT 'PREDICATE' [--by human|agent] [--id ID] [--rests-on RUN,...]",
"  run CHECK -- CMD [ARGS]",
"  review start --as ROLE --ticket F --diff A..B",
"  prove CLAIM FILE THEOREM [--module M]",
"  lint [--strict]",
"  query 'GOAL' [-n N] [--why] [--long]",
"  why 'GOAL' [-n N] [--long]",
"  whynot 'GOAL' [--long]",
"  show [claims|questions|open|blocking|disclosures|extensions|kinds|all] | show pin ID",
"  report [--html FILE [--open]]",
"  pin [--check STAMP]",
"  release",
"  view questions [--dir KB]... [--ledger FILE [--owner KEY]] [--out F]",
"  serve questions [--dir KB]... [--root DIR] [--ledger FILE [--owner KEY]] [--hub DIR]... [--port N]",
"  serve desk [--hub DIR]... [--port N]",
"  draft blocking | draft attach | draft outbound | draft questions  [--hub DIR] [--session S]",
"  pin-item ID SOURCE --text-file F --changed-at T [--kind tracker|file] [--hub DIR] [--session S]",
"  pin-question Q ledger|tracker REF",
"  pin-answer Q REF [--hub DIR | --text-file F --by NAME]",
"  pin-request --request-file F [--accept --by human]",
"  apply-pending",
"  project impact X [--root DIR] | project archive --superseded-before DATE [--root DIR] | project dropped [--hub DIR]",
"  migrate check | migrate plan [--old ENGINE] | migrate apply --seen DIGEST   bring an older KB to this version",
"  signature [--write|--check]      the name/arity of each predicate that this version declares",
"  doctor",
"  version                          the version of the tool (the file VERSION of Sagittarius)",
"  Every write command takes --as ROLE: actor(A, Role, Session) records who wrote (help core).",
"  help [COMMAND|TOPIC]",
"",
"Finding the KB. orbit-kb uses the first of these:",
"  1. the option --dir DIR;",
"  2. the environment variable ORBIT_KB;",
"  3. the nearest directory, from here upward, with a kb.pl that starts with uses([...]).",
"",
"Exit codes:",
"  0  Success. The query is true. Lint is clean.",
"  1  The query has no answer. Lint found errors. orbit-kb rejected the input.",
"  2  Usage error, missing KB or tool, bad goal, a source that lint must fix first, or SWI ERROR.",
"  A typo never exits 1. Exit 1 always means a real \"no\".",
"",
"Engine:",
"  SWI-Prolog answers every query. Negation is negation as failure: not p holds when p has no answer.",
"  So not under(_) means \"no under at all\". A fact that is not recorded is false.",
"  The rules must be stratified: no predicate depends on itself through not (lint E18).",
"  why and whynot explain a verdict from the same clauses. They never change it.",
"  orbit-kb doctor runs known-answer self-tests.",
"",
"Run orbit-kb help COMMAND for details about one command."
]).

% The first line of the general help names the version (D34).
help_lines(general, [First|Ls]) :-
    help_general([First0|Ls]),
    tool_version_text(V),
    sub_atom(First0, 0, _, A, 'orbit-kb:'),
    sub_atom(First0, _, A, 0, Rest),
    format(atom(First), "orbit-kb ~w:~w", [V, Rest]).

