"close --by human --session human, from the hub root).",
"The page (the Desk) is dark at every load. Each section collapses; it is open on load only when",
"it holds something for the human (a question to ask, a refused queued answer, a human action).",
"Asks are in two sections: Human action needed lists only the asks that the owner reserved",
"(hubflow add ask --reserved SOURCE, or set ID --reserved SOURCE; a reserved key in a --ledger file),",
"with the rule or words that reserve them, and the actions that a spec KB keeps for the human by",
"a standing rule (the vote that ends discovery, the approval of a demo, a lapsed waiver);",
"Questions for you lists the other asks, and the asks answered in the last 7 days.",
"--hub repeats: each hub (a mindhole) is a section, with its spec KBs (every kb.pl under the hub),",
"the responses sent from the page, its sessions with their inboxes, and its Orphaned list (a spec",
"KB with no project_kb; one that blocks while no open ledger item has a kb ref to it; an open item",
"that no active session owns; a handoff that nobody accepted). Each item shows its context: the",
"case, the options and what each changes, the default, why it is asked now (raised_by), what",
"waits on it, who holds it (loud when no live session does), and what context is missing.",
"Each card has a form: an answer, a divergence (That is not what I meant: in the KB a human",
"signal and a note on the claim, for an ask a note --by human; the item stays open), or a new",
"requirement (a thread of the review session, with a kb ref or a link to the ask). The text is a",
"draft, saved on the server as you type, until Send. With the hub's .claude/scripts/desk.py, a",
"response is first stored as a letter (flow/desk/letters.jsonl), then written; the page shows",
"where each one is (sent, seen by a session, applied or not). desk.py hook, in the hub's",
"sessions (desk.py hooks prints the settings), tells the session that owns the item at its next",
"stop or prompt, and wakes it through tmux only when it is idle and its item is waiting.",
"Each question to ask shows its notes, its claim's notes and examples, and its due date, and has",
"a form: its options, other, and a free text. Typed text next to a picked option is kept as a",
"note. A default picked as it is keeps its term. The answer never waits on an agent: it goes at",
"once to answers.pending next to kb.pl. When no other writer holds the writer lock (orbit-kb help",
"project), the server applies it now as ORBIT_KB_WRITER, else as human (orbit-kb apply-pending),",
"and gives a lock that was free back. Else the holder's next write applies it; the page and",
"show open list it as pending. The server never uses --take.",
"A question pinned to a ledger ask (pin-question): the answer closes the ask first, then the",
"pinned copy, answer(Q, A, human:OWNER) and answer_pin, goes to the queue. A question pinned to",
"a tracker item is answered in the tracker.",
"Safety: it listens on 127.0.0.1 only; a request whose Host is not 127.0.0.1 or localhost gets",
"403; a POST needs the token of this run, which the page carries. There is no login.",
"The server keeps no state of its own. Ctrl-C stops it.",
"Exit 2 for a usage error, a KB that cannot be found, a bad ledger file, or a port in use."
]).
