help_lines(migrate, [
"orbit-kb migrate check | migrate plan [--old ENGINE] | migrate apply --seen DIGEST [--old ENGINE]",
"",
"Bring a KB that an older orbit-kb wrote to this version (kb-migrations). A migration is a file in",
"share/orbit-kb/migrations/. It declares S, the predicates (name/arity, or lint(Code)) whose rules",
"or facts it changes, and a list of steps. Each step has an owner (tool, agent or human) and a",
"pending query: the step is to do exactly when its query has an answer on the KB. No marker counts.",
"",
"check   One line per step with work: todo MIG STEP OWNER N: WHAT. ITEMS for a tool or agent step,",
"        migrating ... for a human step, retired N/A ... for each retired predicate (lint WM1).",
"        Exit 1 while a tool or agent step is to do; a human step and a retired predicate never",
"        make it fail. Exit 2 when a pending query fails. An agent does the work list of an agent",
"        step with orbit-kb add; the step is done when its query no longer holds.",
"plan    The migration as it would land: each step, the writes, the reach of S (S and each",
"        predicate that reads one in the reach, positively or under not), and each verdict (done,",
"        discovery_ready, gate, blocking, burn_open, flare_open, stale, show open, the lint codes)",
"        that differs between the old side and this orbit-kb on the migrated kb.pl. A verdict that",
"        differs outside the reach is an undeclared change: plan exits 1, and apply refuses it.",
"        --old ENGINE: the old side is that orbit-kb (the version that wrote the KB) on kb.pl as it",
"        is; without it, the old side is this orbit-kb on kb.pl as it is. plan ends with Seen: DIGEST.",
"        Show the plan to the human: the human sees each change before it lands.",
"apply   Writes the tool steps and the questions of the human steps in one atomic rename of kb.pl,",
"        under the KB lock, only with --seen DIGEST of the plan as it is now. It never changes or",
"        removes a line: a retire writes N(_, ..., _) :- !, fail. and retired(N/A, Version, What)",
"        above the first clause of N/A; other facts are appended, each with migration_added(Mig,",
"        Version, Fact) after it. It refuses, with no write: a KB that a newer orbit-kb made, a",
"        spec KB of a hub whose ticket is closed (frozen; hubflow.py kb-state SLUG), a kb.pl that",
"        does not read, a fact that only a human may make (an approval, a vote, a waiver, a human",
"        answer, discovery_end, a decision), and a plan with an error. Run it again: it writes nothing.",
"",
"A human step raises question(Q, H, Text) on the newest current hypothesis (else the first current",
"claim): to_ask(Q) holds until a human answers it, so the KB is not done or discovery_ready.",
"The hub check of all spec KBs: python3 .claude/scripts/hubflow.py migrations.",
"Limits: the reach is computed over this version's rules and rules.pl; the old engine's rules are",
"not read. show open counts as in the reach when blocking/1 or done/0 is."
]).
